# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env is git-ignored.

# No TTS API key needed. server/src/routes/tts.routes.ts generates Gujarati
# (and Hindi/English) audio server-side via Google Translate's public
# text-to-speech endpoint, which requires no signup, key, or billing account
# - the same mechanism the open-source `gTTS` library uses. Nothing to
# configure here for voice to work.

# Already used elsewhere in the server - keep these if you have them set:
# DATABASE_URL=
# JWT_SECRET=
